    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』頑張らなきゃっていうのは──\r\nもちろん、もともと思ってたけどさ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "けど、さっきみたいなことがあると、改めて……！\r\n改めて、気合いが入っちゃうよね……っ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今の結華を見てれば、いい影響をもらったんだなって\r\n誰だってわかる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おやぁ？\r\nそれは、舞い上がりすぎだぞって忠告かな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "違うよ\r\nそれだけ嬉しいことがあってよかったっていうのと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう結華を見られて俺が嬉しいってだけ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……担当アイドルの幸せはプロデューサーの幸せ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あとはほら──\r\n推しが認められていることに対する感謝",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "わー、Ｐたんがアイドルのファンみたいなこと言う",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こらこら\r\nそこは『みたい』じゃないだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初のファンを忘れてもらっちゃ困る",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──え～？　うちの家族を差し置いて\r\nファン第一号だって言い切れる～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700301/1007003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うっ……！\r\nご家族を出されると弱いけど……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──いや、でも！\r\n俺が信じなくてどうするって話だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自信を持って言い切るよ、\r\n俺がアイドル三峰結華のファン第一号だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003010180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは！\r\nＰたんってば相変わらず、恥ずかしいことをしれっと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
